{
  "about": "What the platform makes for a product, and the kit's import makes the same: the SKU a slug and the keys of a variant's values make (base), the first SKU a site has not taken (free), and the key a label makes in the panel (keys). The platform's modules/shop/skus_test.go and the panel's widgets/shop/combinations.test.ts read this file, and the kit's import is held to a copy of it. base: SKUBase(slug, values) is sku, and sku is one the sku kind takes. free: with taken taken (by SKUKey) and, where numbered is { base, from, to }, every <base>-<n> for n from from to to taken too, FreeSKU(base, taken) asked once for each of skus, in order, answers each. keys: the panel's keyOf(label, new Set(taken), fallback) is key. A case is added here, never in a test.",
